---
title: "Zanzibar Tours, Transfers & Packages"
description: "Licensed Zanzibar tour operator for Stone Town walks, spice tours, Safari Blue, dolphin trips, airport transfers and multi-day packages."
permalink: "/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-tagline reveal delay-1">
        <span>✦</span> Licensed ZCT Tour Operator • Transparent Pricing • WhatsApp-First Booking
      </div>
      <h1 class="reveal delay-2">Discover <span class="highlight">Zanzibar</span> with Dhow Coast Travels</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle reveal delay-3">Curated tours, seamless transfers, and multi-day packages. Marine fees included. Stone Town based. <strong>{{ stats.total_tours }} tours, {{ stats.total_hotels }} hotels, {{ stats.total_attractions }} attractions.</strong></p>
      <div class="hero-cta reveal delay-4">
        <a href="/tours/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Browse All Zanzibar Tours</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-trust reveal delay-5">
        <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">✓</span>Licensed ZCT Operator</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">💎</span>Marine Fees Included</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">💬</span>WhatsApp-First Booking</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">📍</span>Stone Town Based</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quick-links">
    <div class="quick-link-card reveal delay-1">
      <div class="quick-link-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M32 8C28.6863 8 26 10.6863 26 14V24H18V14C18 8.9706 21.9706 5 26 5C30.0294 5 34 8.9706 34 14V24H38V14C38 10.6863 35.3137 8 32 8ZM26 26V38H38V26H26ZM18 38H46V42H18V38Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Top Tours & Excursions</h3>
      <p>Spice tours, Stone Town walks, snorkeling, dolphin trips, Safari Blue, Jozani Forest & more.</p>
      <a href="/tours/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Browse Tours</a>
    </div>
    <div class="quick-link-card reveal delay-2">
      <div class="quick-link-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M32 8L14 30V50H50V30L32 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="32" cy="22" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M22 42H42" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Airport Transfers ZNZ</h3>
      <p>Private transfers from Abeid Amani Karume Airport to Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, Stone Town & all zones.</p>
      <a href="/transfers/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Transfers</a>
    </div>
    <div class="quick-link-card reveal delay-3">
      <div class="quick-link-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 22L32 8L48 22V54H16V22Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 34H48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M32 22V34" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Multi-Day Packages</h3>
      <p>3–7 day Zanzibar itineraries combining culture, marine, and nature. Including safari extensions to mainland Tanzania.</p>
      <a href="/packages/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Packages</a>
    </div>
    <div class="quick-link-card reveal delay-4">
      <div class="quick-link-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="8" y="18" width="48" height="38" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M24 26H40M24 34H40M24 42H40M24 50H40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Where to Stay in Zanzibar</h3>
      <p>213 hand-picked hotels and resorts across Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, Stone Town, Kiwengwa, Matemwe & more.</p>
      <a href="/hotels/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Hotels</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats-bar">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-item reveal delay-1">
        <span class="stat-number">{{ stats.total_tours }}</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Tours & Activities</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item reveal delay-2">
        <span class="stat-number">{{ stats.total_hotels }}</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Partner Properties</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item reveal delay-3">
        <span class="stat-number">{{ stats.total_attractions }}</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Attractions & Activities</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item reveal delay-4">
        <span class="stat-number">{{ stats.zones_covered }}</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Zones Covered</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="featured-section section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Featured</span>
        <h2>Most Popular Tours</h2>
        <p>Hand-picked experiences our guests love — from cultural walks to marine adventures.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        {% set featured = tours | limit(6) %}
        {% for tour in featured %}
          <article class="card featured-card reveal" data-category="{{ tour.category }}">
            <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
              {% if __slugMap[tour.seo_slug] %}
                <img src="/images/{{ __slugMap[tour.seo_slug] }}" alt="{{ tour.title }} — Zanzibar" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
              {% endif %}
              <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-badge badge-{{ tour.category | lower }}">{{ tour.category }}</span>
              <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/tours/{{ tour.seo_slug }}/">{{ tour.title }}</a></h3>
              <p class="card-meta">{{ tour.duration }} • {{ tour.location }}</p>
              <p class="card-description">{{ tour.short_description }}</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-price">{{ tour.price.display }} <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
                <a href="/tours/{{ tour.seo_slug }}/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Details</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="view-all reveal"><a href="/tours/" class="btn btn-secondary">View All {{ stats.total_tours }} Tours →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-gradient">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Destinations</span>
        <h2>Best Beaches & Areas in Zanzibar</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Each zone offers a distinct vibe — choose by your travel style: nightlife, kitesurfing, relaxation, or culture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-quick-picks">
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="/images/nungwi-beach-children-swimming-traditional-dhow-boats.jpg" alt="Nungwi beach — children swimming beside traditional dhow boats" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/nungwi/">Nungwi</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">Nightlife • Diving • Sunset Cruises • Turtle Sanctuary</p>
            <p>Northern tip — white sand, full-moon parties, Mnemba Atoll access, traditional dhow building. Best for couples and groups who want action.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="/images/zanzibar-kendwa-beach-aerial-dhow-kayak.jpg" alt="Kendwa beach, Zanzibar — aerial view with dhow and kayak" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/kendwa/">Kendwa</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">Full Moon Parties • All-Day Swimming • Wide Beach</p>
            <p>Northwest — famous for full-moon parties, calm water all day (no tide issues), Kendwa Rocks beach club.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="/images/paje-beach-zanzibar-kitesurfing-indian-ocean.jpg" alt="Paje, Zanzibar — kitesurfing on the turquoise Indian Ocean lagoon" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/paje/">Paje</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">Kitesurfing Capital • Shallow Lagoon • Laid-Back</p>
            <p>Southeast — world-class kitesurfing, turquoise lagoon, seaweed farms, easy access to Jozani Forest & The Rock.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="/images/zanzibar-jambiani-beach-village-life-women.jpg" alt="Jambiani, Zanzibar — authentic fishing village beach life" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/jambiani/">Jambiani</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">Authentic Village • Seaweed Farms • Kuza Cave</p>
            <p>Southeast fishing village — Swahili culture, tide pools, Kuza Cave freshwater pools, Chumbe Island day trips.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="/images/mariola-grobelska-4DhGPppqcDE-unsplash.jpg" alt="Stone Town, Zanzibar — seafront historic architecture" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/stone-town/">Stone Town</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">UNESCO Heritage • History • Culture • Food</p>
            <p>Historic heart — carved doors, Sultan's Palace, Anglican Cathedral (former slave market), Forodhani food market.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="/images/zanzibar-island-resort-pier-boats.jpg" alt="Kiwengwa, Zanzibar — island resort pier and boats" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/kiwengwa/">Kiwengwa</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">All-Inclusive Resorts • Family-Friendly • Mnemba Access</p>
            <p>Northeast — long beach, family-friendly resorts, protected lagoon, easy boat access to Mnemba Atoll marine reserve.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="view-all reveal"><a href="/areas/" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore All 14 Areas →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Plan Your Trip</span>
        <h2>Popular Zanzibar Itineraries</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Ready-made plans based on what travellers search for — from weekend getaways to week-long adventures.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="card reveal" data-category="PKG">
          <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
                <img src="/images/packing-beach.jpg" alt="Zanzibar Essentials package — carved wooden door in Stone Town" loading="lazy">
            <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">Package</span>
            <div class="itinerary-days" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--dct-spice); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">3 Days</div>
            <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/packages/zanzibar-essentials-3day/">Zanzibar Essentials 3-Day</a></h3>
            <p class="card-description">Airport transfers + Stone Town tour + Safari Blue + Spice farm. Our signature intro package.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">$185–$260 <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
              <a href="/packages/zanzibar-essentials-3day/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Itinerary</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" data-category="PKG">
          <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
                <img src="/images/zanzibar-traditional-wooden-boat-turquoise-water.jpg" alt="Beach & Culture Combo — traditional wooden boat on turquoise water" loading="lazy">
            <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">Package</span>
            <div class="itinerary-days" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--dct-spice); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">4–5 Days</div>
            <h3 class="card-title">Beach & Culture Combo</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Stone Town (1 night) + Nungwi/Kendwa (2 nights) + Spice tour + Mnemba snorkeling + sunset cruise.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">Custom quote</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20a%204-5%20day%20Zanzibar%20itinerary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request Quote</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" data-category="SAF">
          <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
                <img src="/images/lukasz-lu8BMgAs64Q-unsplash.jpg" alt="Ultimate Zanzibar + Safari — mainland Tanzania safari" loading="lazy">
            <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-safari">Safari</span>
            <div class="itinerary-days" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--dct-spice); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">7 Days</div>
            <h3 class="card-title">Ultimate Zanzibar + Safari</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Zanzibar highlights (4 nights) + Mikumi/Nyerere fly-in day safari or Serengeti 3-day fly-in.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">From $900 <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
              <a href="/safaris/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Safaris</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Zanzibar Travel FAQs</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Quick answers to the questions travellers ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-grid">
        {% for faq in travelguide.faqs %}
        <details class="faq-item reveal">
          <summary class="faq-question">{{ faq.question }}</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">{{ faq.answer }}</p>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Ready to Experience Zanzibar?</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp with your dates and interests. We'll send a personalized itinerary with transparent pricing within 24 hours.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20to%20plan%20my%20Zanzibar%20trip" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Plan My Trip on WhatsApp</a>
        <a href="/tours/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Browse Tours First</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
